   PROP nevertheless concludes that “**the discharge lifts to every rung**,” S5 says “**ITER-LAW-n holds for EVERY lawful monic Φ₁, every n**,” and FC-2 executes that rider rewrite. The acceptance record conspicuously omits PROP from “WHAT IS ACCEPTED.” Thus an explicitly owed premise was promoted into an all-level conclusion.

